# Quick Reference: Italian Mobile Button Styling

## ✅ What We're Doing

Replicating the **working mobile button styling from index_it.html** to all other language files.

---

## 🎯 The Italian Formula (That Works!)

### Base Styling (Desktop/Tablet):
```css
padding: 8px 16px;     /* was 10px 20px in other files */
font-size: 0.85em;     /* was 0.9-1em */
min-height: 36px;      /* was 44-48px */
gap: 6px;              /* was 8-10px */
```

### Mobile @ 600px and below:
```css
padding: 7px 14px;
font-size: 0.8em;
min-height: 38px;
```

### Mobile @ 400px and below:
```css
padding: 6px 12px;
font-size: 0.75em;
min-height: 36px;
```

---

## ⚡ One-Command Update

